<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🌐 Manajemen & Hub Portal Terpadu - Smart School</title>
    <script src="/js/tailwind.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portal-theme.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f8fafc] text-slate-800 flex min-h-screen antialiased">
    <!-- Sidebar Admin -->
    <%- include('partials/sidebar_admin') %>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="flex-1 ml-64 p-6 md:p-8 overflow-y-auto bg-slate-50/60 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out">
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 mb-8 border-b border-slate-200/80 gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <button onclick="togglePortalSidebar()" class="p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer" title="Toggle Sidebar (Ctrl+B)">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>🌐</span> Manajemen Portal &amp; Gateway Terpadu
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Gerbang akses mandiri untuk seluruh peran sekolah. Setiap portal beroperasi independen tanpa saling bertabrakan.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span> Semua Portal Online
                </span>
                <a href="/" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md shadow-blue-500/20 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all">
                    <span>🏠</span> Buka Halaman Login Utama
                </a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Informasi Arsitektur Terpisah -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 to-indigo-950 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 text-white shadow-lg border border-blue-800/40 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-8 -translate-y-8 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-blue-400/30">
                        🛡️ Arsitektur Role Terisolasi
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-black mt-2">Setiap Portal Memiliki Scope Navigasi &amp; Hak Akses Khusus</h2>
                    <p class="text-blue-200/90 text-xs mt-1 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                        Operator, Guru, Siswa, UKS, BK, dan Perpustakaan berjalan pada rute tersendiri dengan sidebar mandiri. Navigasi di dalam setiap portal tidak akan melompat ke portal admin atau portal peran lain secara tidak sengaja.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md px-5 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/20 text-center">
                    <p class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-300">14</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-blue-100 font-medium">Modul Portal Terintegrasi</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Portal Mandiri & Pusat Kontrol -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

            <!-- 0. PANEL KONTROL FITUR & GEOFENCE -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 via-amber-500/5 to-slate-900/5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-400/40 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 border border-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-inner">
                            🎛️
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-[10px] font-black px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-amber-300">ADMIN &amp; OPERATOR</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span>Panel Kontrol Fitur &amp; GPS</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] bg-amber-500 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-black">39 Fitur</span>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Saklar toggle realtime 39 fitur APK &amp; Web, mode scanner GPS vs QR-only murni, toleransi geofence sekolah, dan jam server WIB.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-600 bg-amber-50/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-amber-800 font-bold">/admin/feature-panel</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse"></span> Kendali Terpusat
                    </span>
                    <a href="/admin/feature-panel" class="px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-all">
                        Buka Panel Kontrol ›
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 1. PORTAL ADMINISTRATOR -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            🏛️
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: ADMIN</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Administrator</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Pusat kendali master data: guru, siswa, kelas, monitoring remote lock, audit presensi gerbang, dan integrasi AI.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/admin</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Aktif (Halaman Ini)
                    </span>
                    <a href="/admin" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 font-bold rounded-xl text-xs transition-colors">
                        Buka Panel ›
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. PORTAL OPERATOR -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            ⚡
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: OPERATOR</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Operator &amp; Proktor</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Manajemen bank soal CBT terintegrasi, buat soal AI Gemini, live monitoring ujian siswa, token proktor, jam pelajaran (JP), dan guru piket.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/operator</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Sidebar Terisolasi</span>
                    <a href="/operator" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Operator ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. PORTAL GURU -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            👨‍🏫
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: TEACHER</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Guru &amp; Wali Kelas</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Jurnal KBM harian, verifikasi surat izin/sakit orang tua, jadwal mengajar, dan bank tugas akademik.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/guru</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Dashboard Guru</span>
                    <a href="/guru" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Portal Guru ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. PORTAL SISWA -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            👨‍🎓
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: STUDENT</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Siswa Terpadu</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Riwayat presensi gerbang, tap absensi JP kelas, nilai tugas, ujian CBT, dan konsultasi BK siswa.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/siswa</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Dashboard Siswa</span>
                    <a href="/siswa" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Portal Siswa ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. PORTAL UKS & KESEHATAN -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            🏥
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: MEDICAL / UKS</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal UKS &amp; Kesehatan Siswa</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Pencatatan pasien sakit baru, inventaris obat &amp; alkes, status bed istirahat, serta antropometri BB/TB berkala.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/uks</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">UKS Full-Feature</span>
                    <a href="/uks" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Portal UKS ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 6. PORTAL BK & KONSELING -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            🕊️
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: COUNSELOR / BK</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal BK &amp; Konseling</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Layanan konseling anonim siswa, catatan disiplin poin pelanggaran, surat peringatan, dan radar kerentanan kesehatan.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/bk</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Bimbingan Konseling</span>
                    <a href="/bk" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Portal BK ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 7. PORTAL PERPUSTAKAAN DIGITAL -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            📚
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: LIBRARIAN</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Perpustakaan &amp; E-Library</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Katalog buku paket barcode, pelacakan buku tertukar antar siswa, sirkulasi peminjaman, dan e-book PDF digital.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/perpustakaan</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Perpustakaan Digital</span>
                    <a href="/perpustakaan" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Perpustakaan ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 8. PORTAL ORANG TUA -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            👨‍👩‍👧‍👦
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Role: PARENT</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Portal Orang Tua / Wali Murid</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Monitoring absensi real-time putra/putri, pengajuan surat izin/sakit dengan lampiran foto, dan surat edaran sekolah.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/orangtua</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Wali Murid</span>
                    <a href="/orangtua" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Portal Orang Tua ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>


            <!-- 10. DISPLAY KELAS KOSONG -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            📋
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Layar Publik Piket</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Display Live Monitoring Kelas Kosong</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Layar TV monitor ruang piket untuk memantau kelas yang belum dihadiri guru pada jam pelajaran berjalan.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/display/kelas-kosong</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">TV Monitor Piket</span>
                    <a href="/display/kelas-kosong" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Layar Display ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 11. PRESENSI GEOFENCE & ANTI-FRAUD -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            📍
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">MODUL 0</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Presensi Geofence &amp; Radar Guru</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Verifikasi presensi anti-kecurangan, toleransi GPS gedung tertutup, verifikasi selfie, dan sinkronisasi offline berurutan.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/admin/geofence-attendance</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Admin &amp; Operator</span>
                    <a href="/admin/geofence-attendance" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
                        Buka Presensi Geofence ›
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 12. BROADCAST PENGUMUMAN MULTI-KANAL -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                            📢
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">SIARAN RESMI</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Broadcast Pengumuman Bertingkat</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                        Siaran informasi prioritas (Biasa/Penting/Mendesak), target bertingkat, preview estimasi audiens, dan pelacakan respon cepat.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                        <span>🔗</span> <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">/admin/pengumuman</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Admin &amp; Operator</span>
                    <a href="/admin/pengumuman" class="px-4 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-sm transition-colors">
